00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.511
the actual documents.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.713
Evan Perez joins us now with the latest.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:16.116
So what's going on here? They can't be.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.984
They literally cannot find this thing.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.352
They literally cannot

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.687
find this thing, Anderson.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.988
And the question is,

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.390
does the president

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.591
have the documents somewhere?

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.892
Did he lose it?

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.527
Didn't even have it

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:30.497
during that July 2021 meeting that

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.333
CNN reported earlier this week

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.101
where he was waving it around.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.236
This was in a meeting

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:37.737
where he was meeting.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.272
He was having a meeting with

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.540
some biographers

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.642
