00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:43.243
And he was

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.544
said to be talking

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:45.945
about this, a battle plan,

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.280
this plan to attack

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.284
Iran and what the issue is

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.086
that the prosecutors

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.654
that are handling this investigation,

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.523
Jack Smith, prosecutors

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.591
had sent a subpoena asking for

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.860
any and all documents related to Iran

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:02.729
related to this possible meeting

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.731
