00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.966
They, of course, did this after

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.535
bringing in one of his closest aides,

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:09.536
a communications

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.671
aide, Margaux Margaux Martin,

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.473
who was inside that meeting.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.141
She was brought before the grand jury.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.210
She was played a recording

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:18.344
from that meeting.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.746
And that's when prosecutors

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.781
then issued a subpoena to the Trump team

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.483
asking for all of these documents,

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.752
any of these documents to be brought in,

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.154
according to the trunk legal team,

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.522
they don't know

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:30.890
whether this document exists.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:31.791
And they also don't know

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.526
whether during that July

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.494
meeting, Anderson,

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.161
whether the president

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.229
was just making it up

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.730
or whether it's somewhere else.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.331
Right now.

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:39.899
And is that the Trump legal team,

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:40.500
its position right

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.001
now, that they still don't know where

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.169
they have they?

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.537
What's been the response to?

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.338
Well, you know,

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:46.539
they respond

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.040
as you've seen

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.842
a variety of their responses

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.910
over the course of this investigation,

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.445
including calling this, obviously

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:53.947
a political witch hunt.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.081
The former president

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:56.182
in a town

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:56.916
hall with

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:57.450
Fox News

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.686
said that he has no knowledge of this

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:00.453
July meeting.

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:01.621
And they say

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:02.589
that they still don't know,

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:04.424
obviously, where this document is

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.493
that prosecutors are so interested in.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:06.793
The thing

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.061
is, Anderson, the bottom line here

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:09.362
is that prosecutors

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.531
throughout months have insisted

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:12.765
that they believe

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.335
Trump has continued to possess

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:16.970
classified documents

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.471
