00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:38.338
Well,

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:39.372
he doesn't have a defense,

00:05:39.372 --> 00:05:41.240
so I guess he can say whatever he wants.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:41.641
I mean, all

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:42.308
everything he does

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:44.110
say, though, will be used against him.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:44.977
But the fact of the matter

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:46.279
is, there's just no dispute.

00:05:46.279 --> 00:05:48.281
I mean, even at the time of the

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:49.082
search warrant

00:05:49.082 --> 00:05:50.783
execution back last August,

00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:51.017
I mean,

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.685
we saw the search warrant affidavit,

00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:54.587
the affidavit used by the FBI

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:55.855
to get the search warrant.

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.690
I mean, there was just a

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.792
it was virtually an open and shut case

00:05:59.792 --> 00:06:00.226
then.

00:06:00.226 --> 00:06:01.327
I mean, he had the documents.

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:02.462
He refused to give them back.

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:03.996
He lied about giving them back.

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:04.697
And then they went

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:06.032
and they executed a search warrant

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:07.600
and they found all these documents.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.001
So I don't know that

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:10.870
it makes his statements like that

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.039
make it any worse for him.

00:06:13.039 --> 00:06:13.740
They don't certainly don't

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:15.007
make it better.

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:15.775
Secretary Cohen,

00:06:15.775 --> 00:06:16.843
I mean, obviously, the U.S.

00:06:16.843 --> 00:06:17.276
works

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:18.144
with relies

00:06:18.144 --> 00:06:21.347
on allies in its intelligence gathering.

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:22.715
How does not being able to locate

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:25.852
a document like this or even the notion

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:27.854
that a former president would be

00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:29.822
waving around a document like this,

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:30.590
how does that impact

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:31.290
other nations

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.492
willingness to work with

00:06:32.492 --> 00:06:34.360
and share intelligence with the U.S.?

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.862
Well, it

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:38.097
it really erodes and corrodes

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:39.899
our credibility.

00:06:39.899 --> 00:06:41.934
For example, the former president

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:43.302
fell following the firing

00:06:43.302 --> 00:06:45.338
of the FBI director the very next day,

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:46.739
released information

00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:48.040
to the Russian foreign

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.709
minister and Russian ambassador

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:51.377
that may have compromised

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:52.412
the intelligence

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.346
from Israel,

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:55.314
compromising one of their assets.

00:06:55.314 --> 00:06:57.917
So every time one of these take place,

00:06:57.917 --> 00:06:58.918
the other countries have to

00:06:58.918 --> 00:06:59.585
say, is

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:00.820
the information we're giving

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.188
to the United States

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:03.689
going to be protected?

00:07:03.689 --> 00:07:06.192
Because we have people at risk

00:07:06.692 --> 00:07:07.193
on the front

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:10.096
lines, our ambassadors, our military,

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:11.197
they're all at risk.

00:07:11.197 --> 00:07:12.799
And so when we turn information

00:07:12.799 --> 00:07:14.000
over to the United States,

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.501
we expect it to be

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:17.737
really handled with the greatest of care.

00:07:17.904 --> 00:07:20.239
And that clearly is not the case here.

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:21.441
The president has demonstrated

00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:22.742
time and time again.

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:23.876
George, what does this signal to you

00:07:23.876 --> 00:07:24.944
about the timeline?

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:25.545
Or does it

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:25.845
I mean,

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:27.046
I don't know if it signals anything,

00:07:27.046 --> 00:07:28.314
but what do you think about the timeline

00:07:28.314 --> 00:07:29.282
in the special counsel's office?

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:29.382
Well,

00:07:29.382 --> 00:07:31.484
I think the timeline generally

00:07:31.484 --> 00:07:33.219
I think, is just suggested

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:36.322
by the fact that we know so much now

00:07:36.322 --> 00:07:37.423
about the investigation,

00:07:37.423 --> 00:07:38.491
because what happens in these

00:07:38.491 --> 00:07:39.692
in these investigations

00:07:39.692 --> 00:07:42.128
is that there are lots of witnesses

00:07:42.128 --> 00:07:43.763
and the witnesses, one by one, go in

00:07:43.763 --> 00:07:44.564
and they're interviewed

00:07:44.564 --> 00:07:46.966
by the Justice Department or the FBI, and

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:48.935
and they're sending to the grand jury.

00:07:48.935 --> 00:07:50.036
And now you're getting to the point

00:07:50.036 --> 00:07:52.271
where there are so many people who know

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:54.474
and the lawyers all share information

00:07:55.508 --> 00:07:57.009
to make sure that, you know, their

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.444
their client is not saying anything

00:07:58.444 --> 00:07:59.612
that's being conducted,

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:01.380
contradicted by some other

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.949
lawyers client.

00:08:02.949 --> 00:08:04.417
They're sharing all this information.

00:08:04.417 --> 00:08:05.251
That means lots

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:06.052
and lots of people

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:08.254
know a lot about this investigation,

00:08:08.254 --> 00:08:09.789
which is why we're seeing this flood

00:08:09.789 --> 00:08:11.057
of information interesting.

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:12.658
Which tells me

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:14.894
that this investigation is nearly done.

00:08:15.127 --> 00:08:16.229
And when you think about it,

00:08:16.229 --> 00:08:17.363
you look at the calendar.

00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:18.130
I mean,

00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:19.398
you want to get

00:08:19.398 --> 00:08:21.133
I mean, if you were

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:23.302
Jack Smith, I mean, you're not rushing it

00:08:23.302 --> 00:08:24.337
for political purposes,

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:25.171
but you're rushing

00:08:25.171 --> 00:08:27.540
to avoid the political implications

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.642
of having this

00:08:29.642 --> 00:08:30.810
having an indictment issued

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.445
during an election season

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:35.114
and of having a trial to late next year.

00:08:35.114 --> 00:08:37.383
If you want to have a trial next summer

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:38.417
or earlier,

00:08:38.417 --> 00:08:39.185
earlier next year,

00:08:39.185 --> 00:08:40.353
you got to bring this case sooner.

00:08:40.353 --> 00:08:40.987
Rather than later.

00:08:40.987 --> 00:08:41.821
And you want to bring

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:43.456
you want to bring these charges before

00:08:43.456 --> 00:08:44.824
the campaign really gets underway,

00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:46.893
because that way you insulate yourself

00:08:46.893 --> 00:08:48.227
from the charge that you're doing it

00:08:48.227 --> 00:08:49.262
for political purposes.

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:49.862
But I think

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:51.063
when when this indictment

00:08:51.063 --> 00:08:52.732
comes out, it's going to be a blockbuster

00:08:52.732 --> 00:08:54.934
because given that what we know,

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:56.536
it's an open and shut case

00:08:56.536 --> 00:08:57.570
many times over,

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:59.338
and I'm sure it's going to be a very,

00:08:59.338 --> 00:09:00.373
very interesting indictment

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:01.507
of George Conway.

00:09:01.507 --> 00:09:02.508
William Cohen, I appreciate it.

00:09:02.508 --> 00:09:03.209
Thank you both for.

